          "details": "Unticks \"Allow files on this drive to have contents indexed\" on every fixed drive except C: (as Explorer's \"Apply changes to this drive only\"). Check: the drive's root folder carries the \"not content indexed\" attribute [Uncertain: confirm it matches the box in the drive's Properties].",
